          "id": 2149078277,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@guyharris Is there any official list of compilers wireshark is expected to support? Are we sure wireshark currently builds on that list? Is there a way to test if I'm adding a regression regarding this topic?\n\nI plan to use it to define packed structs, related to:\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/17579\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/17326\n\nI'm already using it in this same patch in packet‎-amr.h‎, since the __attribute__((packed)) was dropped from it in a fixup commit in master because it was failing for MSVC.",
