    {
      "id": "b968aebe0a99f911ba01e1100a3fc401e7980206",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2150272325,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Ok, so since it has become clear that the use of packed structs is not wanted in wireshark I think the outcome is to abandon this MR and I'll rework https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/17326 to use buffers and bitfield operations instead.",
